d `ButtonGroup` each accept all `Flex` layout props."],[979,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[594,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[597,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[593,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[595,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[596,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[598,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1263,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[364,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[404,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[893,"`Enter/Space`"],[447,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[685,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[413,"`Escape`"],[813,"`Escape`"],[895,"`Escape`"],[1535,"`Escape`"],[483,"`FieldGroup` is purely presentational — it renders the styled `Group` and holds no React Aria context. The surrounding field wires value, disabled, and validation state into its controls."],[484,"`FieldGroup` rounds its outer corners from DOM order: the group's CSS rounds the start corners of its **first child** and the end corners of its **last child**, so controls are seamless inside and rounded only at the box edges. Author children in visual order and the rounding follows — no per-control positioning prop. A lone control (a TextField input, a Select trigger) is both first and last, so it rounds both edges. The rules are RTL-safe (they use logical `start`/`end` corners)."],[480,"`FieldLabel`, `FieldDescription`, and `FieldError` each render `null` when they have no co